  "description": "French Avenue Amber Empire is a rich amber-oriental fragrance that blends smooth sweetness with warm woods and subtle spice. Released in 2025 , it’s designed for men who want a bold, elegant scent with depth and sophistication. The opening introduces warm oriental notes mixed with creamy vanilla, soft cashmere wood, and a hint of liquor that creates a smooth, slightly boozy sweetness. The heart reveals glowing amber combined with cedarwood and sugar cane, adding warmth and refined sweetness. The base settles into tonka bean, sandalwood, musk, and labdanum, producing a deep, smooth, long-lasting trail with luxurious amber warmth. Amber Empire is ideal for evening wear and cooler weather, delivering a confident, sophisticated presence with a warm amber signature.",
